[{"id":181286956,"discussion_id":"c800c73fa79f95e3b592251429fe08e4df5d3e68","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修改了 `matmul_v3_base_tiling_advanced.h` 中获取 `attrs` 属性索引的方式：将原来通过固定位置常量 `ENABLE_UNCACHE_INDEX`（值为 5）和 `SHIFT_VALUE_INDEX`（值为 6）访问属性的逻辑，改为仅在 `DAV_RESV` 架构下通过属性总数动态计算倒数第 2 和倒数第 1 个位置来获取 `enableUncache` 和 `shiftValue`，使属性访问不再依赖硬编码的绝对索引。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **移除固定索引常量**：删除了 `ENABLE_UNCACHE_INDEX`（值为 5）和 `SHIFT_VALUE_INDEX`（值为 6）两个 `static constexpr` 常量，不再使用硬编码的绝对位置访问属性。\n- **改为动态倒数索引访问**：在 `compileInfo_.npuArch == NpuArch::DAV_RESV` 分支内，通过 `attrs->GetAttrNum() - 2` 和 `attrs->GetAttrNum() - 1` 分别获取 `enableUncacheAttr` 和 `shiftValuePtr`，使属性访问与属性列表尾部对齐，而非依赖固定偏移。\n- **收窄 `attrs` 获取范围**：`context_->GetAttrs()` 的调用从无条件执行改为仅在 `DAV_RESV` 架构分支内执行，并将 `supportMmadS8S4_ = true` 的设置一并移入该分支。\n- **调整空指针检查逻辑**：当 `attrs` 为空时，仅输出警告日志，不再尝试访问其成员，避免潜在的空指针解引用。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-23T11:06:49+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-23T11:10:01+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181286957,"discussion_id":"da9c26b6f5279e94ffdc71312ff3f2656d411790","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 关闭摘要\n\n| 文件 | 审查结论 |\n|---|---|\n| `matmul/mat_mul_v3/op_host/op_tiling/arch35/matmul_v3_base_tiling_advanced.h` | 发现 3 个问题（含 1 个信息确认） |\n\n**按等级统计：**\n- **P0**：1 个 — 空指针解引用，`attrs` 为 nullptr 时日志警告后仍继续执行到 `attrs->GetAttrNum()`，必崩溃。\n- **P1**：1 个 — 缺少 `attrsNum >= 2` 的下界检查，`attrsNum - 2` / `attrsNum - 1` 在 attrsNum 不足时触发越界或无符号回绕。\n- **P3**：1 个 — 确认删除的 `ENABLE_UNCACHE_INDEX` / `SHIFT_VALUE_INDEX` 常量无跨文件引用，安全移除。\n\n**整体风险判定：高。** P0 空指针解引用问题在任何 `GetAttrs()` 返回 nullptr 的 DAV_RESV 场景下必然触发运行时崩溃，建议在合入前修复。P1 越界访问在当前属性布局下触发概率较低，但作为防御性编程缺陷仍需补齐检查。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 2 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 0 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-23T11:06:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-23T11:12:53+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181286977,"discussion_id":"d0a683c6b3af0d4796ca3a372c478302721f9125","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n wuyufei, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-23T11:06:57+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-23T11:06:57+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181286981,"discussion_id":"8b268bfe6aa7bd5a6c2736fbadb809dfc20e5e57","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| matmul | ✅ [*林鹏翔*](https://gitcode.com/LinPX), [*商晓波*](https://gitcode.com/sxb154714) (2/2) | ✅ [*商晓波*](https://gitcode.com/sxb154714) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Ti