r 的任何 DAV_RESV 运行时导致段错误崩溃。旧代码通过将属性读取代码放在 `if (attrs != nullptr && ...)` 保护中正确避免了此问题。修复：当 `attrs == nullptr` 时，要么提前返回 `ge::GRAPH_FAILED`，要么跳过整个属性读取块（例如，用 `else` 分支确保空指针路径不会到达第 81 行）。\n\n**建议**：在 attrs 为空时提前返回或跳过后续 attrs 操作。推荐将第 78-80 行的 if 块改为：若 attrs 为空则跳过整个属性读取（使用 else），或直接 return ge::GRAPH_FAILED。\n\n```suggestion\n            if (attrs == nullptr) {\n                OP_LOGW(context_->GetNodeName(), \"enable_uncache attr not registered, use default.\");\n                return ge::GRAPH_SUCCESS;\n            }\n```\n","created_at":"2026-07-23T11:12:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-23T11:21:53+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68a27e1fe6740e25e8668b54","login":"wuyufei","object_id":"68a27e1fe6740e25e8668b54","name":"wuyufei","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wuyufei"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":82,"end_new_line":82,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":181288585,"discussion_id":"bae6f333afb8caa9de2cf31e43b56006a03df5af","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n第 83 行和第 86 行使用 `attrsNum - 2` 和 `attrsNum - 1` 作为属性索引，但没有验证 `attrsNum >= 2`。若 `GetAttrNum()` 返回无符号类型（如 `size_t` / `uint64_t`），当 `attrsNum` 为 0 或 1 时，减法运算发生无符号回绕，产生巨大索引值（如 `UINT64_MAX - 1`），导致 `GetAttrPointer()` 以越界索引访问，引发未定义行为或崩溃。若返回带符号类型，则索引为负同样非法。\n\n旧代码（已删除）通过 `attrs->GetAttrNum() > ENABLE_UNCACHE_INDEX`（即 `> 5`）和 `attrs->GetAttrNum() > SHIFT_VALUE_INDEX`（即 `> 6`）检查，在访问索引 5 和 6 之前确保了属性数量足够。新代码缺少等效保护。修复：在第 81 行之后、第 83 行之前添加 `if (attrsNum < 2)` 的守卫检查并提前返回或使用默认值。\n\n**建议**：在第 81 行获取 attrsNum 后、第 83 行使用索引前，添加 `attrsNum < 2` 的守卫检查：若 attrsNum 不足 2，则使用默认值并提前返回或跳过属性读取。","created_at":"2026-07-23T11:12:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-23T11:21:47+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68a27e1fe6740e25e8668b54","login":"wuyufei","object_id":"68a27e1fe6740e25e8668b54","name":"wuyufei","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wuyufei"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":94,"end_new_line":94,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":181291346,"discussion_id":"211885855ac0a8d68fc14de097f80871afb1bff4","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-07-23T11:22:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-23T11:22:04+08:00","user":{"id":"68a27e1fe6740e25e8668b54","login":"wuyufei","object_id":"68a27e1fe6740e25e8668b54","name":"wuyufei","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wuyufei"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181291887,"discussion_id":"aa21312ebb3f2e024d31d0c2601d10f552f1a0d3","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=4143f02599ec4369807ba5ec5f84c57c&projectName=CANN'>4143f02599ec4369807ba5ec5f84c57c</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86_ubuntu24</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=4143f02599ec4369807ba5ec5f84c57c&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/7853/cann-ops-nn_linux-x86_64_ubuntu24.run>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                 